WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:02.501
-Uh, before you go, I thought --

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:04.300
I thought maybe we could play a
game inspired by your new movie,

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.667
"Next Goal Wins."
What do you think of this?

00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:09.267
-I think that's a great idea.
-Let's do it. Here we go.

00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:10.534
-I mean...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.534 --> 00:00:11.834
-♪ Next Goal Wins ♪

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:14.334
♪ Next Goal, Next Goal Wins ♪

00:00:14.334 --> 00:00:16.734
♪ Next Goal Wins ♪

00:00:16.734 --> 00:00:20.968
-Now, "Next Goal Wins"
is about soccer.

00:00:20.968 --> 00:00:22.300
In America, we don't really know
soccer that well,

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:23.601
but we're getting to learn.

00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:25.601
-But here's what we do know
in America.

00:00:25.601 --> 00:00:27.667
-Baseball.
-Yeah, we know baseball.

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:29.601
But here's what I have.
I have soccer balls,

00:00:29.601 --> 00:00:32.167
I have baseball bats,
and a basketball hoop.

00:00:32.167 --> 00:00:34.601
We're gonna bat the soccer balls
into the hoop.

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:36.868
Whoever gets a basket
first wins.

00:00:36.868 --> 00:00:38.968
Get it?
Next goal --

00:00:38.968 --> 00:00:41.067
-Next basket goal wins.
-Well, that's a sequel.

00:00:41.067 --> 00:00:42.234
Yeah, all right, here we go.
All right.

00:00:42.234 --> 00:00:43.701
Let's go.
-Let's do it.

00:00:43.701 --> 00:00:45.601
-Good luck.
-Okay. You ready?

00:00:45.601 --> 00:00:47.400
-Ready, and go, yeah.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:51.701
♪♪

00:00:51.701 --> 00:00:53.801
-Yes!

00:00:53.801 --> 00:00:55.267
Ah.

00:00:55.267 --> 00:00:58.100
♪♪

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.133
-Are you coming close?

00:01:00.133 --> 00:01:02.734
[ Audience exclaims ]

00:01:02.734 --> 00:01:06.033
Are you getting even close?
-Yes.

00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:08.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:08.634 --> 00:01:10.100
-Come on!

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:13.334
This guy can do anything.

00:01:13.334 --> 00:01:17.133
This guy can do anything!
Taika Waititi!

00:01:17.133 --> 00:01:19.767
His movie, "Next Goal Wins,"
is in theaters

00:01:19.767 --> 00:01:21.133
everywhere this Friday.

00:01:21.133 --> 00:01:23.267
Rachel Zegler joins us
after the break.

00:01:23.267 --> 00:01:24.801
Stick around everybody.

